# ==== Data & Model Artifacts ====
# Keep raw/processed data & trained models out of git history —
# they're large, binary, and regenerable from source scripts.
data/raw/*
data/processed/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/processed/.gitkeep

models/*.pkl
models/*.joblib
!models/.gitkeep

